message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Smart Parking System"
abstract: >-
  Edge-based parking occupancy detection with a two-stage vision pipeline
  (parking-space quadrilaterals, perspective warp, YOLOv8-cls, temporal
  smoothing), a FastAPI backend, and web + mobile apps including a
  photo-based Find My Car feature.
